        // To capture the revert difference: the bug version may revert due to the require(callResult) after a 0-value call to an EOA? No, call with 0 value to EOA succeeds.
        // Hence we need an adversarial counterparty: a contract that reverts when receiving 0 value.
        // Deploy a Reverter helper and make the caller be that helper.
    }
}

